{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001150/extras/676c24d1d677941ebaff0e6a5b987771.avif?t=1762431191\" width=620 height=240 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sellsword Tales is a nonlinear visual novel with RPG and quest elements. This blend of genres creates a rich fantasy world filled with danger and incredible discoveries!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001150/extras/424347c9794b9e8ae5fd5cd81cf999f6.poster.avif?t=1762431191\" width=694 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001150/extras/424347c9794b9e8ae5fd5cd81cf999f6.webm?t=1762431191\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001150/extras/424347c9794b9e8ae5fd5cd81cf999f6.mp4?t=1762431191\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A lot of events await Tabitha along her adventure. The outcome of the whole story depends on how she behaves. The choice is yours!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001150/extras/012955758d1303582a2a500509f4104b.avif?t=1762431191\" width=620 height=240 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some characters will become your enemies, while others can become allies you can trust. It\u2019s up to you to decide whether these relationships stay as friendships or develop into something more. Your choices will affect how these connections evolve throughout the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main heroine decides to set out on a journey, taking her family\u2019s heirloom armor and sword.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will she find loyal friends and companions, acquire powerful weapons and legendary artifacts, and stand against evil and injustice?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And will she have the strength to resist the demonic temptation that awaits her?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001150/extras/c240bdf949a189867f0eb054df4a1e63.poster.avif?t=1762431191\" width=674 height=398 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001150/extras/c240bdf949a189867f0eb054df4a1e63.webm?t=1762431191\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001150/extras/c240bdf949a189867f0eb054df4a1e63.mp4?t=1762431191\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Magical creatures, monsters, and beasts, depraved cultists, and greedy bandits - all await the heroine on her challenging path to glory! <br>Engage in exciting turn-based battles and earn valuable rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001150/extras/6eb399ac2f0006f93cdc03109ea54f58.poster.avif?t=1762431191\" width=674 height=398 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001150/extras/6eb399ac2f0006f93cdc03109ea54f58.webm?t=1762431191\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001150/extras/6eb399ac2f0006f93cdc03109ea54f58.mp4?t=1762431191\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to combat challenges, players will encounter various mini-games designed to add variety to the gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Write your own story in the world of <i>Sellsword Tales</i>!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4001150?t=1762431191","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4001150?t=1762431191","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001150/300adf0493ccc1612b4613df4ce3e082563e24d7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762431191","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001150/300adf0493ccc1612b4613df4ce3e082563e24d7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762431191","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,3,4,5],"notes":"This game contains adult content. All characters involved in the adult content are adults.\r\nContent warning: explicit sexual content (including non-consensual sex), BDSM(tied with ropes, domination - submission), nudity, depictions of violence, alcohol abuse,  alcohol and tobacco use. Player discretion is advised."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001150/extras/676c24d1d677941ebaff0e6a5b987771.avif?t=1762431191\" width=620 height=240 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sellsword Tales is a nonlinear visual novel with RPG and quest elements. This blend of genres creates a rich fantasy world filled with danger and incredible discoveries!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/stea